  "firstFailuresRetained": [
    "Upstream prebuilt Mac SVG workers pass the local-root check but fail the hosted-runner-root check; replacement workers pass both.",
    "Linux graph fixture assumed creation order was directory enumeration order; independent native enumeration now determines expected duplicate-basename resolution.",
    "One Windows Vega run exceeded the existing 12-second limit. No timeout or assertion was relaxed; the full release-source CI later passed. This is not a performance certification."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Default Gatekeeper rejects ad-hoc bundles; users must allow this specific application after checking the download.",
    "Intel execution was Rosetta on Apple Silicon; physical Intel and old macOS remain untested.",
    "Human visual review, first-launch security approval, physical shortcut and IME interactions remain untested.",
    "The native QA driver uses a debug build; production release cold startup, signatures and actual SVG output have separate artifact checks.",
    "The earlier extended LF-source byte-guard failures remain historical evidence; the related checks here are not whole-contract acceptance.",
    "Native menu/tray, Finder file associations and real AI provider flows require separate Mac evidence."
  ],
